&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who we are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Artefact&lt;/strong&gt; is the next generation end-to-end data and AI service company that helps organizations transform data into value and business impact.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our broad range of data and AI driven solutions in consulting are designed to meet our clients’ specific needs, always conceived with a business-centric approach and delivered with tangible results.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We have 2500+ employees across 36 offices who are focused on accelerating data and AI transformation. Thanks to a unique mix of company assets: State of the art data &amp;amp; AI technologies, agile methodologies for fast delivery, and cohesive teams of the finest business consultants, data analysts, AI engineeres, data engineers, and digital experts, all dedicated to bringing extra value to every client.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About The Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Areas of Responsibility&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As an Applied AI Engineer, your role will encompass:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;- Conducting ambitious projects in the transformation of clients through data &amp;amp; AI.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;- Collaborating with the other Divisions (Activation, Creativity, and Strategy) to provide comprehensive&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;services to your clients.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;- Developing privileged relationships with our clients, using your technical abilities to assist in the&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;transformation of their organisation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Among your responsibilities as an Applied AI Engineer, you will be responsible for:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Delivering data &amp;amp; AI projects&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Securing delivery on your projects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communicating your work and achievements among the team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working closely with your Consulting counterpart to build and maintain strong relationships with your clients and best understand their needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensuring that your solutions bring value to the client’s business problem.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Applying statistics, machine learning and agentic solutions where they are the right answer to the client’s question, from framing the problem to validating the result.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Being a good team player, knowing your role and responsibility in the global ambition.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Building AI / agentic solutions for clients&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Designing and building AI solutions — machine learning models, large language model agents, retrieval, tool calling, orchestration and workflow automation — that solve concrete business problems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Taking these solutions into production inside the client’s environment: their data platforms, their infrastructure, their security and compliance constraints.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Designing, building, testing, deploying and evaluating these systems, and continuously improving them after go-live.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working on site with client teams, business and technical, to turn requirements into technical designs, prototypes and shipped systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Documenting and handing over what you build, so the client’s teams can run and extend it.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Holding the engineering standard: version control, code review, testing and reproducibility.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Being a great tech person&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrating the skill and credibility required to ensure the success of our clients’ initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Researching and developing new technical approaches to address problems efficiently.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sharing best practices and contributing to Artefact’s institutional knowledge.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Turning field experience into reusable assets — accelerators, templates and evaluation libraries — that other teams can pick up.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Embodying Artefact’s values and inspiring others to do the same.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Competences &amp;amp; Skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A Master’s degree in machine learning, mathematics, computer science, or related fields.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;At least 1 year of hands-on experience developing and applying data-driven solutions in a corporate or consulting setting, preferably in a consumer marketing context (experience in the AI industry is a plus).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong knowledge of data processing, data modeling, algorithms, and data architecture.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong grounding in statistics and machine learning: statistical analysis and inference, experiment design and measurement, model training, evaluation and interpretation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience building solutions on top of large language models: prompt and context design, retrieval-augmented generation, tool calling, agentic workflows and orchestration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid software engineering practice: version control, code review, testing and documentation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to explain technical trade-offs to both business and technical stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Intellectual curiosity and excellent problem-solving skills, including the ability to structure and prioritise, with an approach for maximum impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Belief&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe data &amp;amp; AI is changing the world, and it’s just the beginning. We want this to be done in the right way, with transparency and ethics. This is the only way to create sustainable impact for business and society.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Mission&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are on a mission to build the next generation of data leaders who:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fully capture the power of data &amp;amp; digital to deliver business value;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bring understanding, trust &amp;amp; transparency of data and AI into our society.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Values&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaboration: People of different background and expertise working closely together;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Trust &amp;amp; Transparency: Dealing with data topics with integrity and ethics; Realistic and honest with our capabilities and limitations;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Innovation: Always working on the most trendy and new topics on data and digital; Always on top of the new ways of using data;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Action: We would rather do than to tell what to do; Has a “building the plane while flying” agile mentality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Unique Attributes&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We bring great value to business and create a better society with the understanding, transparency and ethical use of data&amp;nbsp;and AI;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We build the next generation of data leaders;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We disrupt the market:
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;AI Native - A culture that encourages daily AI tool usage, experimentation, and continuous skill updates&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;ART + SCIENCE - Mixture of talents in ART (Creative, Planning, Media, Consumer Engagement) and SCIENCE (AI Strategy, AI Engineer, Data Engineer)&amp;nbsp;;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;End to End - Capabilities from Strategize to Build to Run.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Au sein de l’équipe Artefact Open Innovation, entité du groupe Artefact, l’assistant chef(e) de projet aura pour mission de participer aux initiatives d’animation et de développement d’un ou plusieurs&amp;nbsp;écosystèmes (Finance, Santé, Planet, Quantum...)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Gestion de projet événementiel&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;● En appui du chef(fe) de projet contribuer à l’organisation d’événements tout au long de l’année (salon annuel, masterclasses, autres événements de networking en France et potentiellement à l’international...) : cadrage des projets, suivi du plan d’action, rétroplanning, pilotage des projets, suivi des supports et de la logistique, paramètrage de la plateforme évènementielle, actions de communication.&lt;br&gt;● Participer à la programmation : identifier des thématiques pertinentes et des&amp;nbsp;intervenants (acteurs clés, partenaires, entrepreneurs, chercheurs, personnalités&amp;nbsp;politiques), répondre aux demandes liées à leur participation, contribuer à la&amp;nbsp;préparation de l’intervention des speakers&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Animation de communauté et communication&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;● Contribuer à la veille : identifier les sujets d’actualité, répertorier les articles et études en lien avec le secteur et l’activité de nos partenaires&lt;br&gt;● Participation à la création des contenus éditoriaux et à la mise en œuvre du plan&amp;nbsp;de communication (Newsletters, posts réseaux sociaux, production et suivi des&amp;nbsp;campagnes marketing événementielles, mise à jour du site) en collaboration avec&amp;nbsp;l’équipe de communication et la cheffe de projet.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Profil recherché pour un stage de fin d’étude :&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Étudiant en fin d’étude de niveau Bac+5 / Master 2, école de commerce, ou parcours&amp;nbsp;universitaire de management&lt;br&gt;Une appétence aux sujets de l’IA et de la Data serait appréciée.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Nous cherchons avant tout à agrandir nos équipes dans la durée, une embauche en CDI&amp;nbsp;à l’issue du stage est envisageable&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compétences recherchées&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;● Rigueur et esprit de synthèse&lt;br&gt;● Esprit entrepreneurial, Force de proposition et sens de l&#39;initiative&lt;br&gt;● Aisance à l&#39;oral, excellentes qualités de présentation&lt;br&gt;● Bon niveau d&#39;anglais écrit et oral&lt;br&gt;● Qualités relationnelles affirmées et ouverture d’esprit&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Condition :&lt;/strong&gt; stage de Septembre 2025 à Février 2026&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Business Driver, 50–60%&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who is Artefact?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Artefact is a next-generation strategy and data consulting firm dedicated to transforming organisations through data and AI. We combine the rigour of top-tier strategy consulting with deep expertise in data, digital and analytics to help clients achieve tangible business impact. With 2,500+ consultants, data scientists and engineers, we work with global leaders such as Samsung, L’Oréal, Orange and Sanofi. Our Swiss team is growing fast and has just moved into a new office in central Zurich.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our Zurich team has grown to a size where keeping the office and the team’s operations running is a job in its own right. With our new office, we now have the place for it, and we are looking for the person to take it on. As our Business Driver, you keep support for our leadership, recruiting, events and the office itself running smoothly, and you help with billing, so that our consultants, partners and directors can focus on their clients.&lt;/p&gt;
