&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Basics&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Office: &lt;/strong&gt;Neumühlequai 6, Zurich&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Start: &lt;/strong&gt;January 2027&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hours: &lt;/strong&gt;50–60%, worked as full days in the office rather than half days. We agree on the exact days with you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Join Us&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build the Role: &lt;/strong&gt;You are the first Business Driver in our Zurich office. You decide how the office runs, and your work is visible to everyone from the first day. This means significant growth opportunities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Close to Leadership: &lt;/strong&gt;You work directly with our partners and directors and see first-hand how a consulting business is built.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Culture of Doers: &lt;/strong&gt;Innovation, action, collaboration. We are entrepreneurial and fast-moving, committed to delivering impact while supporting each other’s growth.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Central Location: &lt;/strong&gt;Our office is in the heart of Zurich, within walking distance of the main station (HB).&lt;/p&gt;
