&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you will be doing:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will join our Data and Consulting team, which helps clients transform and improve their data strategy by applying advanced analytics to generate insights that create business value from big data and artificial intelligence.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Innovate. You will work with your team, consisting of consultants, data scientists, and engineers, to identify client needs and define innovative solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Learn and Share. You will work in a collaborative team that promotes knowledge sharing. You will learn from others, share knowledge, and stay up to date with industry news/updates&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop. You will be involved in the solution from start to finish. With the help of senior scientists, you will manage the design and implementation, as well as optimize performance and scalability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work across the entire project value chain (data collection and processing, exploratory data analysis, application of machine learning models, model production)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demystify technical terms or solutions for more business-oriented profiles, can work in a team with very diverse profiles&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prioritize your tasks, respect deadlines, and raise your hand in case of risks or problems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we are looking for:&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Having completed an undergraduate course in data science, machine learning, mathematics, computer science, statistics, engineering, economics, or a related field.&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Desirable a first knowledge in statistics and programming (Python/R).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Curiosity: you are always looking for innovative solutions for your clients. You are involved in the entire value chain.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaboration: knowledge sharing is essential for you and you actively participate in the dissemination of information within Artefact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Entrepreneurship: you bring solutions, new ideas, innovations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluent English: You are comfortable communicating in English, as it is essential for working in our international environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
