&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with GenAI concepts: RAG, agents, prompting, context engineering.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exposure to a major AI or cloud platform (Google, Anthropic, OpenAI; GCP, Azure, AWS).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience contributing to proposals or thought leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
