&lt;h2 data-start=&quot;107&quot; data-end=&quot;126&quot;&gt;Who is Artefact?&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;127&quot; data-end=&quot;406&quot;&gt;Artefact is a next-generation strategy and data consulting firm dedicated to transforming organizations through data and AI. We combine the rigor of top-tier strategy consulting with deep expertise in data, digital, and analytics to help clients achieve tangible business impact.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;408&quot; data-end=&quot;795&quot;&gt;With 1,800+ consultants, data scientists, and engineers across 23 countries, we work with global leaders such as Samsung, L’Oréal, Orange, and Sanofi. Our Romandie office (Geneva/Lausanne) is at the heart of Artefact’s growth, advising clients on their most pressing strategic challenges — from AI strategy and governance to digital transformation roadmaps and new business model design.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 data-start=&quot;797&quot; data-end=&quot;821&quot;&gt;Main Responsibilities&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;822&quot; data-end=&quot;1096&quot;&gt;As a &lt;strong data-start=&quot;827&quot; data-end=&quot;879&quot;&gt;Senior Technical Consultant / Senior AI Engineer&lt;/strong&gt;, you will lead the design and delivery of impactful AI and data solutions. You’ll combine hands-on engineering with client advisory, guiding multi-disciplinary teams from opportunity framing to production deployment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;1098&quot; data-end=&quot;2600&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1098&quot; data-end=&quot;1326&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1100&quot; data-end=&quot;1326&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1100&quot; data-end=&quot;1141&quot;&gt;Own solution architecture &amp;amp; delivery:&lt;/strong&gt; Define end-to-end architectures (data, ML/LLM, APIs, security), make build/buy decisions, and drive projects from PoC to production with reliability, observability, and cost in mind.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1327&quot; data-end=&quot;1512&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1329&quot; data-end=&quot;1512&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1329&quot; data-end=&quot;1360&quot;&gt;Lead complex PoCs &amp;amp; pilots:&lt;/strong&gt; Scope, prototype, and validate AI/ML use cases (incl. LLMs/GenAI, RAG, fine-tuning, evaluation) and convert successful pilots into scalable products.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1513&quot; data-end=&quot;1754&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1515&quot; data-end=&quot;1754&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1515&quot; data-end=&quot;1551&quot;&gt;Advanced programming &amp;amp; modeling:&lt;/strong&gt; Build, adapt, and evaluate ML/DL/LLM models using Python (PyTorch, TensorFlow, HuggingFace, LangChain/LlamaIndex), including prompt engineering, fine-tuning/LoRA, vector search, and safety/guardrails.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1755&quot; data-end=&quot;1927&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1757&quot; data-end=&quot;1927&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1757&quot; data-end=&quot;1782&quot;&gt;Cloud &amp;amp; MLOps/LLMOps:&lt;/strong&gt; Design and operate solutions on Azure, GCP, or AWS (CI/CD, containers, model serving, feature stores, vector DBs, monitoring, eval pipelines).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1928&quot; data-end=&quot;2127&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1930&quot; data-end=&quot;2127&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1930&quot; data-end=&quot;1975&quot;&gt;Client advisory &amp;amp; stakeholder management:&lt;/strong&gt; Translate business goals into technical roadmaps, present to senior stakeholders, manage risks and trade-offs, and ensure measurable business impact.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;2128&quot; data-end=&quot;2265&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;2130&quot; data-end=&quot;2265&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;2130&quot; data-end=&quot;2165&quot;&gt;Quality, security &amp;amp; governance:&lt;/strong&gt; Enforce best practices on data privacy, model risk management, responsible AI, and documentation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;2266&quot; data-end=&quot;2425&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;2268&quot; data-end=&quot;2425&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;2268&quot; data-end=&quot;2300&quot;&gt;Team leadership &amp;amp; mentoring:&lt;/strong&gt; Coach engineers/consultants, perform code and design reviews, and help shape delivery standards and reusable accelerators.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;2426&quot; data-end=&quot;2600&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;2428&quot; data-end=&quot;2600&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;2428&quot; data-end=&quot;2463&quot;&gt;Pre-sales &amp;amp; thought leadership:&lt;/strong&gt; Support proposals, estimates, and statements of work; contribute to assets, talks, and publications that advance Artefact’s AI offering.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 data-start=&quot;2602&quot; data-end=&quot;2622&quot;&gt;Candidate Profile&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;2623&quot; data-end=&quot;2715&quot;&gt;Engineer first, consultant second — with a builder’s mindset and a track record of shipping.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;2717&quot; data-end=&quot;3945&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;2717&quot; data-end=&quot;2874&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;2719&quot; data-end=&quot;2874&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;2719&quot; data-end=&quot;2734&quot;&gt;Experience:&lt;/strong&gt; 5–8+ years in data/ML/AI engineering or adjacent roles, including &lt;strong data-start=&quot;2801&quot; data-end=&quot;2849&quot;&gt;end-to-end delivery of production AI systems&lt;/strong&gt; (not just prototypes).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;2875&quot; data-end=&quot;3010&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;2877&quot; data-end=&quot;3010&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;2877&quot; data-end=&quot;2893&quot;&gt;Programming:&lt;/strong&gt; Expert Python; solid software engineering (testing, packaging, CI/CD). SQL required; Java/Scala/TypeScript a plus.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;3011&quot; data-end=&quot;3145&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;3013&quot; data-end=&quot;3145&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;3013&quot; data-end=&quot;3023&quot;&gt;AI/ML:&lt;/strong&gt; Hands-on with ML/DL and &lt;strong data-start=&quot;3048&quot; data-end=&quot;3056&quot;&gt;LLMs&lt;/strong&gt; (prompting, fine-tuning/LoRA, embeddings/RAG, evaluation &amp;amp; observability, guardrails).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;3146&quot; data-end=&quot;3266&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;3148&quot; data-end=&quot;3266&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;3148&quot; data-end=&quot;3158&quot;&gt;Cloud:&lt;/strong&gt; Deep experience on &lt;strong data-start=&quot;3178&quot; data-end=&quot;3194&quot;&gt;at least one&lt;/strong&gt; major cloud (Azure, GCP, or AWS) deploying secure, scalable services.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;3267&quot; data-end=&quot;3504&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;3269&quot; data-end=&quot;3504&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;3269&quot; data-end=&quot;3286&quot;&gt;MLOps/LLMOps:&lt;/strong&gt; Containers (Docker/Kubernetes), Git, pipelines (e.g., GitHub Actions/Cloud-native), model serving (FastAPI/TorchServe/Triton), experiment tracking, model registry, vector DBs (FAISS, Pinecone, pgvector, OpenSearch).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;3505&quot; data-end=&quot;3640&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;3507&quot; data-end=&quot;3640&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;3507&quot; data-end=&quot;3531&quot;&gt;Architecture &amp;amp; data:&lt;/strong&gt; Designing data/ML platforms, APIs, microservices; familiarity with data pipelines and streaming is valued.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;3641&quot; data-end=&quot;3761&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;3643&quot; data-end=&quot;3761&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;3643&quot; data-end=&quot;3665&quot;&gt;Consulting skills:&lt;/strong&gt; Requirements gathering, storytelling, senior stakeholder management, and clear documentation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;3762&quot; data-end=&quot;3876&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;3764&quot; data-end=&quot;3876&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;3764&quot; data-end=&quot;3778&quot;&gt;Languages:&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong data-start=&quot;3779&quot; data-end=&quot;3812&quot;&gt;Fluency in French and English&lt;/strong&gt; (written &amp;amp; spoken).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;3877&quot; data-end=&quot;3945&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;3879&quot; data-end=&quot;3945&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;3879&quot; data-end=&quot;3900&quot;&gt;Work eligibility:&lt;/strong&gt; You must be eligible to work in Switzerland.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;3947&quot; data-end=&quot;3963&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;3947&quot; data-end=&quot;3963&quot;&gt;Nice to have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;3964&quot; data-end=&quot;4225&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;3964&quot; data-end=&quot;4062&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;3966&quot; data-end=&quot;4062&quot;&gt;Experience with responsible AI/governance frameworks, security reviews, and cost optimization.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;4063&quot; data-end=&quot;4158&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;4065&quot; data-end=&quot;4158&quot;&gt;Domain experience in one or more industries (e.g., retail, pharma, manufacturing, finance).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;4159&quot; data-end=&quot;4225&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;4161&quot; data-end=&quot;4225&quot;&gt;Contributions to open-source, publications, or conference talks.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 data-start=&quot;4227&quot; data-end=&quot;4241&quot;&gt;Why Join Us&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;4242&quot; data-end=&quot;4752&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;4242&quot; data-end=&quot;4359&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;4244&quot; data-end=&quot;4359&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;4244&quot; data-end=&quot;4274&quot;&gt;Strategy with a Data Edge:&lt;/strong&gt; Operate at the intersection of boardroom strategy and cutting-edge AI engineering.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;4360&quot; data-end=&quot;4494&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;4362&quot; data-end=&quot;4494&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;4362&quot; data-end=&quot;4389&quot;&gt;Romandie Office Impact:&lt;/strong&gt; High visibility from day one; help shape our Swiss footprint and work directly with senior leadership.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;4495&quot; data-end=&quot;4630&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;4497&quot; data-end=&quot;4630&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;4497&quot; data-end=&quot;4519&quot;&gt;Learning &amp;amp; Growth:&lt;/strong&gt; Advanced training across strategy, AI/ML/LLM, and cloud; international missions and communities of practice.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;4631&quot; data-end=&quot;4752&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;4633&quot; data-end=&quot;4752&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;4633&quot; data-end=&quot;4654&quot;&gt;Culture of Doers:&lt;/strong&gt; Innovation, action, collaboration. We move fast, deliver impact, and support each other’s growth.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;4754&quot; data-end=&quot;4796&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;4754&quot; data-end=&quot;4767&quot;&gt;Location:&lt;/strong&gt; Lausanne / Geneva (Romandie)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;4798&quot; data-end=&quot;4942&quot; data-is-last-node=&quot;&quot; data-is-only-node=&quot;&quot;&gt;If you don’t meet 100% of the criteria, we still want to hear from you. Passion, curiosity, and impact orientation matter — tell us about yours.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who/What is Artefact?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Artefact is a next-generation strategy and data consulting firm dedicated to transforming organizations through data and AI. We combine the rigor of top-tier strategy consulting with deep expertise in data, digital, and analytics to help clients achieve tangible business impact. With 2,000+ consultants, data scientists, and engineers across 26 countries, we work with global leaders such as Samsung, L’Oréal, Orange, and Sanofi. At our German offices, we are on a rapid growth trajectory, advising leading national and international clients cross-industry on how to unlock the full potential of their data, build scalable data architectures, and implement cutting-edge AI solutions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a &lt;strong&gt;Senior Consultant (m/f/d) Data &amp;amp; AI Strategy&lt;/strong&gt;, you will sit at the center of this mission. You won&#39;t just deliver static slides; you will bridge the gap between technical possibilities and business imperatives, guiding clients from a focused short-term engagement with &lt;em&gt;Mittelstand&lt;/em&gt; manufacturers to multi-phase AI transformations with enterprises. In this role, you will take ownership of cross-functional workstreams, drive data-driven decision-making, and actively shape the digital future of our clients.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you will do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Client advisory &amp;amp; strategy:&lt;/strong&gt; Work closely with (international) clients to understand their business needs and translate them into data-driven recommendations that support strategic decision-making and business transformation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data &amp;amp; analysis:&lt;/strong&gt; Collect, synthesise and iterate data to create actionable insights. You work with a modern, AI-native toolstack - from LLM-powered environments (e.g. Claude, Gemini, ChatGPT) and agentic workflow tools (e.g. n8n, Lovable) to coding assistants and automation platforms - and communicate findings clearly to both technical and non-technical stakeholders. Familiarity with SQL or Python remains a plus, but the ability to leverage AI tools to accelerate analysis and delivery is what we value most.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Project delivery:&lt;/strong&gt; Take ownership of project workstreams and ensure high-quality, timely delivery in alignment with overall project goals. Work collaboratively within interdisciplinary teams across consulting, data, and tech functions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data &amp;amp; AI solutions:&lt;/strong&gt; Support the development of data strategies, AI use cases, and business intelligence solutions, contributing to governance frameworks and implementation roadmaps where relevant.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Knowledge sharing &amp;amp; collaboration:&lt;/strong&gt; Contribute to a strong team culture by sharing knowledge, staying up to date with digital and AI trends, and supporting continuous team development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Business development &amp;amp; thought leadership:&lt;/strong&gt; Actively contribute to Artefact’s growth in Germany - supporting client proposals, shaping new service offerings, and creating intellectual capital such as frameworks, point-of-views, and benchmarks that strengthen our market position.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Candidate Profile&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At our heart, we define ourselves by a culture of ownership, intellectual curiosity, and cooperation. &lt;strong&gt;We are looking for driven, capable talents who bring strong motivation and curiosity for new challenges.&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience:&lt;/strong&gt; You have at least 2–3 years of experience in management consulting, technology consulting, or in-house corporate strategy roles, with a proven track record of participating in data/AI strategy, cloud transformation, or applied AI/Machine Learning projects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Education:&lt;/strong&gt; A completed university degree (Bachelor’s or Master&#39;s) in Business Administration, Economics, Computer Science, Business Informatics, Physics, Mathematics, or a comparable quantitative field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data &amp;amp; AI Fluency:&lt;/strong&gt; You possess a strong affinity for data management and modern AI technologies. You are familiar with concepts like Generative AI, LLMs, or predictive analytics and are eager to bridge the gap between business needs and AI deployment. Ideally, you have hands-on experience in AI use case conceptualization or data platform tracking.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Business &amp;amp; analytical mindset:&lt;/strong&gt; You combine strong analytical skills with a business-oriented perspective. You enjoy identifying business problems and translating them into practical AI and data-driven solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical skills:&lt;/strong&gt; You are confident working with PowerPoint and Google Slides to produce polished client-ready output. More importantly, you know how to leverage AI tools - from LLM environments to agentic workflows - to run analysis, generate insights, and accelerate delivery. Experience with SQL, BI tools, or programming languages is not a requirement, but comfort with structured data and a hands-on attitude toward new tools is expected.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Communication &amp;amp; collaboration:&lt;/strong&gt; You communicate complex technical topics clearly in both German and English. You enjoy working in interdisciplinary teams and collaborating across different levels and functions (e.g., translating requirements between business stakeholders and data scientists).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Personal attributes:&lt;/strong&gt; You are proactive, structured, and solution-oriented, with a strong client focus and stakeholder understanding. You thrive in dynamic environments and enjoy solving complex problems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Languages:&lt;/strong&gt; Business-fluent German and English are required - you will participate in client workshops, present to senior stakeholders, and write deliverables in both languages. Additional languages are a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work Eligibility:&lt;/strong&gt; A valid work permit for Germany.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why ARTEFACT?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Impactful client work:&lt;/strong&gt; Work on challenging projects with leading national and international clients across data, digitalisation, and advanced data strategy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Career growth opportunities:&lt;/strong&gt; We believe in performance over tenure. Your growth is driven by your impact, not your length of service, with clear opportunities to progress and diverse career prospects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Competitive rewards:&lt;/strong&gt; A strong compensation package including a performance-based bonus, which is paid out half-yearly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Learning &amp;amp; development:&lt;/strong&gt; Join a team of passionate Data Consultants who actively support each other. You&#39;ll learn through diverse projects, collaboration, and exposure to leading experts in the field - including international work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Flexibility &amp;amp; time off: &lt;/strong&gt;Hybrid working model, 28 days of annual leave, plus your birthday as well as Christmas &amp;amp; New Year&#39;s Eve&amp;nbsp;off.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;This position is based in Berlin or Munich.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Don&#39;t worry if you don&#39;t meet all the criteria!&lt;/strong&gt; At Artefact, we value motivation, pragmatic problem-solving, and potential above all else.If you are excited about shaping the future of AI and ready to make a real impact, we&#39;d love to hear from you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Diversity &amp;amp; Inclusion at Artefact&lt;/strong&gt; &amp;gt; We believe that unique perspectives fuel innovation. At Artefact, we are committed to creating an inclusive environment where everyone can thrive. We welcome and consider all applications purely based on merit, skills, and potential - regardless of gender identity, sexual orientation, race, ethnicity, religion, age, background, or disability. Come as you are!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ready to take the next step?&lt;/strong&gt; Please submit your CV showcasing your experience and passion for this role as a Senior Consultant (m/f/d) Data &amp;amp; AI Strategy. We look forward to receiving your application!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;job-preview__description &quot; data-test-description=&quot;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;If you have any questions, feel free to send us a message at bewerbungen-de@artefact.com.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;h2 data-path-to-node=&quot;2&quot;&gt;Über uns: Wer/Was ist Artefact?&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;3&quot;&gt;Artefact ist eine weltweit führende Beratung für Daten- und KI-Dienstleistungen mit Hauptsitz in Paris. Mit mehr als 2.000 Consultants, Data Scientists und Engineers in 26 Ländern arbeiten wir mit den globalen Marktführern zusammen. An unseren deutschen Standorten befinden wir uns auf einem rasanten Wachstumskurs. Wir beraten führende nationale und internationale Kunden branchenübergreifend dabei, das volle Potenzial ihrer Daten auszuschöpfen, skalierbare Datenarchitekturen aufzubauen und innovative KI-Lösungen zu implementieren.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;4&quot;&gt;Als &lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;4&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;4&quot;&gt;Senior Consultant (m/w/d) Data &amp;amp; AI Strategy&lt;/strong&gt; stehst du im Mittelpunkt dieser Mission. Du lieferst nicht nur statische Präsentationen, sondern schlägst die Brücke zwischen technologischen Möglichkeiten und geschäftlichen Anforderungen. Dabei begleitest du unsere Kunden von fokussierten Kurzzeit-Projekten im gehobenen Mittelstand bis hin zu mehrphasigen KI-Transformationen in Großkonzernen. In dieser Rolle übernimmst du die Verantwortung für crossfunktionale Workstreams, treibst datenbasierte Entscheidungen voran und gestaltest die digitale Zukunft unserer Kunden aktiv mit.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;4&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 data-path-to-node=&quot;6&quot;&gt;Das erwartet dich bei uns:&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;7,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;7,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Kundenberatung &amp;amp; Strategie:&lt;/strong&gt; Du arbeitest eng mit (internationalen) Kunden zusammen, verstehst deren geschäftliche Anforderungen und übersetzt diese in datengestützte Empfehlungen, die strategische Entscheidungen und die Business Transformation unterstützen.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;7,1,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;7,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Daten &amp;amp; Analyse:&lt;/strong&gt; Du sammelst, strukturierst und bereitest Daten für Analysen auf. Mit Tools wie Excel, SQL und Python identifizierst du Trends, Muster und konkrete Handlungsempfehlungen und kommunizierst diese klar an technische sowie nicht-technische Stakeholder.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;7,2,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;7,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Projektumsetzung:&lt;/strong&gt; Du übernimmst die Verantwortung für Projekt-Workstreams und stellst eine qualitativ hochwertige, termingerechte Lieferung im Einklang mit den übergeordneten Projektzielen sicher. Dabei arbeitest du kollaborativ in interdisziplinären Teams aus den Bereichen Consulting, Data und Tech.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;7,3,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;7,3,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Daten- &amp;amp; KI-Lösungen:&lt;/strong&gt; Du unterstützt die Entwicklung von Datenstrategien, KI-Use-Cases sowie Business-Intelligence-Lösungen und wirkst bei Governance-Frameworks und Implementierungs-Roadmaps mit.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;7,4,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;7,4,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Wissenstransfer &amp;amp; Kollaboration:&lt;/strong&gt; Du trägst zu einer starken Teamkultur bei, indem du dein Wissen teilst, dich über digitale Trends und KI-Entwicklungen auf dem Laufenden hältst und die kontinuierliche Weiterentwicklung des Teams unterstützt.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 data-path-to-node=&quot;9&quot;&gt;Das bringst du mit:&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;10&quot;&gt;Im Kern definieren wir uns über eine Kultur der Eigenverantwortung, der intellektuellen Neugier und der Zusammenarbeit. Wir suchen motivierte, fähige und umsichtige Talente, die hungrig auf neue Herausforderungen sind und die Chance nutzen wollen, zu lernen und zu wachsen.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;11,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;11,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Berufserfahrung:&lt;/strong&gt; Du verfügst über mindestens 2-3 Jahre Erfahrung in der Management-/Datenberatung oder in einer entsprechenden Inhouse-Funktion. Zudem bringst du nachweisbare Erfolge in den Bereichen Daten-/KI-Strategie, Cloud-Transformation oder angewandte KI-/Machine-Learning-Projekte mit.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;11,1,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;11,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Daten- &amp;amp; KI-Verständnis:&lt;/strong&gt; Du besitzt eine hohe Affinität für Datenmanagement und moderne KI-Technologien. Konzepte wie Generative KI, LLMs oder Predictive Analytics sind dir vertraut und du brennst darauf, die Lücke zwischen Business-Anforderungen und KI-Einsatz zu schließen. Idealerweise hast du bereits Erfahrung in der Konzeption von KI-Use-Cases oder im Data-Platform-Tracking.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;11,2,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;11,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Business-Orientierung &amp;amp; analytisches Denken:&lt;/strong&gt; Du verbindest ausgeprägte analytische Fähigkeiten mit einer geschäftsorientierten Denkweise. Es macht dir Spaß, geschäftliche Herausforderungen zu identifizieren und sie in praktische, KI- und datengestützte Lösungen zu übersetzen.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;11,3,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;11,3,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Technische Fähigkeiten:&lt;/strong&gt; Du bist sicher im Umgang mit Excel und PowerPoint. Praktische Erfahrung mit Statistik-Tools, BI-Software oder Programmiersprachen wie SQL, R oder Python zur Datenexploration und -aufbereitung ist ein klares Plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;11,4,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;11,4,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Kommunikation &amp;amp; Teamgeist:&lt;/strong&gt; Du kommunizierst komplexe technische Themen sowohl auf Deutsch als auch auf Englisch klar und verständlich. Du arbeitest gerne in interdisziplinären Teams und schätzt die Zusammenarbeit über verschiedene Ebenen und Funktionen hinweg (z. B. als Übersetzer der Anforderungen zwischen Business-Stakeholdern und Data Scientists).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;11,5,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;11,5,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Persönlichkeit:&lt;/strong&gt; Du agierst proaktiv, strukturiert sowie lösungsorientiert und zeichnest dich durch eine ausgeprägte Kunden- und Stakeholder-Orientierung aus. Du blühst in dynamischen Umfeldern auf und hast Freude daran, komplexe Probleme zu lösen.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;11,5,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sprachkenntnisse:&lt;/strong&gt; Sehr gute Deutsch- und Englischkenntnisse sind eine Grundvoraussetzung. Du wirst an Kunden-Workshops teilnehmen, Präsentationen vor hochrangigen Entscheidungsträgern halten und Dokumente in beiden Sprachen verfassen. Weitere Sprachkenntnisse sind von Vorteil.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;11,7,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;11,7,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Arbeitserlaubnis:&lt;/strong&gt; Eine gültige Arbeitserlaubnis für Deutschland.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 data-path-to-node=&quot;13&quot;&gt;Warum ARTEFACT?&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;14,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;14,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Einflussreiche Kundenprojekte:&lt;/strong&gt; Arbeite an anspruchsvollen Projekten mit führenden nationalen und internationalen Kunden in den Bereichen Daten, Digitalisierung und zukunftsweisende Datenstrategie.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;14,1,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;14,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Karriere- und Entwicklungschancen:&lt;/strong&gt; Wir glauben an Leistung, nicht an Dienstalter. Dein Aufstieg wird durch deinen Impact bestimmt, nicht durch deine Betriebszugehörigkeit - mit klaren Aufstiegsmöglichkeiten und vielfältigen Karriereperspektiven.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;14,2,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;14,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Attraktive Vergütung:&lt;/strong&gt; Ein starkes Vergütungspaket inklusive eines leistungsabhängigen Bonus, der halbjährlich ausgezahlt wird.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;14,3,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;14,3,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Lernen &amp;amp; Weiterentwicklung:&lt;/strong&gt; Werde Teil eines Teams aus passionierten Data Consultants, die sich gegenseitig aktiv unterstützen. Du lernst durch vielfältige Projekte, enge Zusammenarbeit und den Austausch mit führenden Experten der Branche - internationale Einsätze eingeschlossen.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;14,4,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;14,4,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Flexibilität &amp;amp; Freizeit:&lt;/strong&gt; Unbegrenztes Homeoffice und flexible Arbeitszeiten, 28 Tage Jahresurlaub sowie zusätzliche freie Tage über die Feiertage (Weihnachten und Silvester frei) und an deinem Geburtstag.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Diese Position ist für die Standorte Berlin oder München ausgeschrieben.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;15,0&quot;&gt;Keine Sorge, wenn du nicht alle Kriterien erfüllst! Bei Artefact schätzen wir Motivation, pragmatische Problemlösungskompetenz und Potenzial über alles. Wenn du hungrig auf neue Herausforderungen bist und die KI-Revolution leidenschaftlich mitgestalten willst, freuen wir uns von dir zu hören.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;15,1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;15,1&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Vielfalt &amp;amp; Inklusion bei Artefact:&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;em&gt;Wir sind überzeugt, dass einzigartige Perspektiven Innovationen vorantreiben. Bei Artefact setzen wir uns für ein inklusives Umfeld ein, in dem jeder sich entfalten kann. Wir begrüßen und berücksichtigen alle Bewerbungen rein auf Basis von Leistung, Fähigkeiten und Potenzial – unabhängig von geschlechtlicher Identität, sexueller Orientierung, Herkunft, Ethnizität, Religion, Alter, Hintergrund oder Behinderung. Komm so, wie du bist!&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;16&quot;&gt;Bereit für den nächsten Schritt? Bitte sende uns deinen Lebenslauf, der deine Erfahrung und deine Leidenschaft für die Rolle als &lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;16&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;146&quot;&gt;Senior Consultant (m/w/d) Data &amp;amp; AI Strategy&lt;/strong&gt; zeigt. Wir freuen uns auf deine Bewerbung!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;16&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;17&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Bei Fragen kannst du uns gerne eine Nachricht an &lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;17&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;49&quot;&gt;bewerbungen-de@artefact.com&lt;/strong&gt; senden.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h2&gt;Who is Artefact?&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Artefact is a next-generation strategy and data consulting firm dedicated to transforming organisations through data and AI. We combine the rigour of top-tier strategy consulting with deep expertise in data, digital and analytics to help clients achieve tangible business impact.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;With 2,500+ consultants, data scientists and engineers, we work with global leaders such as Samsung, L’Oréal, Orange and Sanofi. Our Swiss offices are at the heart of Artefact’s growth, advising clients on their most pressing strategic challenges — from AI strategy and governance to digital transformation roadmaps and new business model design.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Main Responsibilities&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Senior Consultant in our Zurich/Lausanne office, you will work at the intersection of strategy consulting and data and AI delivery. You will:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategy Development:&lt;/strong&gt; Work with client leadership teams to address high-stakes questions. How can AI reshape our business model? How should we govern and organise for data? Which strategic programmes deliver the most impact?&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Structured Problem-Solving:&lt;/strong&gt; Break complex challenges down into decisions a client can act on, combining consulting rigour with a working knowledge of what current AI can and cannot actually do.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Solution Design:&lt;/strong&gt; Turn a business question into a solution shape — what data it depends on, what kind of platform or product it should sit on, and what “good” looks like once it is built. You will do this alongside our data scientists and engineers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Project Delivery:&lt;/strong&gt; Support engagements end to end, from hypothesis framing and market and competitor analysis through to data maturity assessments, client workshops, governance design and implementation roadmaps.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Client Engagement:&lt;/strong&gt; Work closely with C-level stakeholders and business unit leaders. You will build trusted relationships, communicate recommendations with clarity, and keep the work aligned to what the client is actually trying to decide.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Knowledge &amp;amp; Practice Building:&lt;/strong&gt; Contribute to the growth of Artefact&#39;s Zurich office by shaping new offerings, creating intellectual capital - frameworks, thought pieces, benchmarks - and taking part in business development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Candidate Profile&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for someone who can hold a technical position and a commercial one at the same time. The strongest candidates meet most of the following.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Education:&lt;/strong&gt; A degree in Computer Science, Engineering, Data Science, Business, Economics or a related field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work Experience:&lt;/strong&gt; Around three to five years in consulting, or in a technical/date-focussed role with client-facing responsibility.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Business Acumen &amp;amp; AI Fluency:&lt;/strong&gt; A genuine dual affinity for business and technology. You are comfortable with modern data and AI concepts - generative AI and LLMs, retrieval, predictive machine learning, cloud platforms - and with what they cost and where they fail, not only with what they are called.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical Depth:&lt;/strong&gt; You have built AI or data products, not only advised on them. You can explain why you chose which model you put on which part of the work, and what that choice did to both output quality and cost. You will not be writing production code in this role, but you should have the basic understanding.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Analytical &amp;amp; Problem-Solving Skills:&lt;/strong&gt; Strong quantitative and analytical skills, and the judgement to know which number actually decides the question. You are comfortable getting to a defensible estimate with your assumptions stated out loud.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Communication &amp;amp; Interpersonal Skills:&lt;/strong&gt; Excellent written and verbal communication. You enjoy working in teams and in front of clients.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Languages:&lt;/strong&gt; Fluency in German/French and English, written and spoken, is strongly preferred..&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work Eligibility:&lt;/strong&gt; You must be eligible to work in Switzerland.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Why Join Us&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategy and the Build:&lt;/strong&gt; Artefact is neither a traditional strategy consultancy nor a pure technology player. You will move between the boardroom and the build, and be expected to be credible in both.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Engineers, not hand-offs:&lt;/strong&gt; Our 2,500 people include the data scientists and engineers you will work beside on the same engagement - not a delivery organisation you hand a slide deck to.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Zurich Office Impact:&lt;/strong&gt; As part of a growing Swiss team you will have visibility and impact from the first day. You will help shape Artefact&#39;s footprint in the region and work directly with senior leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Learning &amp;amp; Growth:&lt;/strong&gt; Regular training in both consulting method and AI and data capability, combined with international exposure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Culture of Doers:&lt;/strong&gt; Innovation, action, collaboration. We are entrepreneurial and fast-moving, committed to delivering impact while supporting each other&#39;s growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This position is based in &lt;strong&gt;Zürich or Lausanne&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Join Artefact Belgium: Help our clients in their AI transformations&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Are you an analytically minded consultant with a passion for data, AI, and business transformation? Artefact Belgium is looking for a Senior Consultant – Strategy &amp;amp; Data/AI to help our clients navigate their most complex strategic challenges at the intersection of business and technology. If you have 2-4 years of consulting or related experience, combined with a dual affinity for strategy and data, we&#39;d love to hear from you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who We Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Artefact is a next-generation consulting firm dedicated to transforming organizations through data and AI. We combine the rigor of top-tier strategy consulting with deep expertise in AI applications to help clients achieve tangible business impact. Our Belgium office advises clients on their most pressing strategic challenges : from AI strategy and governance to digital transformation roadmaps and new business model design. Our inclusive and forward-thinking culture encourages creativity, collaboration, and professional growth.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who You Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic thinker:&lt;/strong&gt; You break down complex business problems into clear, structured recommendations. You are comfortable operating at the C-level and translating ambiguity into actionable insights.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data-savvy consultant:&lt;/strong&gt; You don&#39;t need to be a programmer, but you are genuinely curious about data and AI technologies and eager to deepen your expertise in this space.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Project &amp;amp; Engagement Leader:&lt;/strong&gt; You have a proven capacity to lead projects client side. You excel at managing expectations, defining project scope, and providing strategic guidance to technical teams to ensure delivery aligns with business objectives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Client-facing communicator:&lt;/strong&gt; You build trusted relationships with senior stakeholders, present ideas with clarity, and adapt your message to both technical and non-technical audiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaborative doer:&lt;/strong&gt; You thrive in multidisciplinary teams, move fast, and take ownership of your work from day one.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ambitious and driven:&lt;/strong&gt; You are motivated by impact, eager to grow, and excited by the opportunity to help shape a fast-growing office.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Will Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive strategy development: &lt;/strong&gt;Work with client leadership teams to address high-stakes questions — How can AI reshape our business model? How should we govern and organize for data? Which strategic programs deliver the most impact?&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Solve complex problems:&lt;/strong&gt; Break down ambiguous challenges into clear, actionable recommendations using structured frameworks, enriched by Artefact&#39;s data and AI expertise.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Deliver end-to-end engagements:&lt;/strong&gt; Support projects from hypothesis framing and market/competitor analysis to client workshops, governance design, and implementation roadmaps with the technical team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Engage senior stakeholders:&lt;/strong&gt; Collaborate closely with C-level executives and business unit leaders, building trusted relationships and ensuring strategic alignment throughout engagements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build knowledge and offerings: &lt;/strong&gt;Contribute to the growth of Artefact&#39;s Belgium office by shaping new service offerings, creating intellectual capital (frameworks, thought pieces, benchmarks), and supporting business development efforts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Contribute to thought leadership: &lt;/strong&gt;Publish insights, participate in industry events, and help position Artefact Belgium as a leading voice on AI and data transformation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A Bachelor&#39;s and Master&#39;s degree (preferred) in Business, Engineering, Computer Science, Economics, or a related field; an excellent academic track record is highly valued.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Approximately 2-4 years of experience in strategy consulting, data/digital consulting, or a related field (including internships or business analyst roles).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A dual affinity for business and technology — you enjoy solving complex problems and can approach challenges in a structured, strategic way.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with data and digital technologies (e.g. analytics, AI, machine learning concepts, digital marketing, cloud platforms); you don&#39;t need to be a programmer, but you should be tech-savvy and eager to grow in the data/AI domain.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent written and verbal communication skills, with experience creating impactful presentations and reports for senior audiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in English and French or Dutch is required; additional languages are a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You must be eligible to work in Belgium.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We Offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive compensation aligned with your expertise and experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A unique positioning at the crossroads of boardroom-level strategy and cutting-edge AI — not a traditional consultancy, not a pure tech player.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Visibility and impact from day one as part of a growing Belgian team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Professional growth through regular training in both strategy consulting methodologies and AI/data capabilities, combined with international exposure across Artefact&#39;s global network.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A collaborative, entrepreneurial culture of doers — innovative, fast-moving, and committed to delivering impact while supporting each other&#39;s growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;This position is based in Brussels, with opportunities to collaborate on projects worldwide.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;At Artefact Belgium, we value motivation and potential above all else. Don&#39;t worry if you don&#39;t meet every criterion — if you&#39;re passionate about leveraging data and AI to drive real business impact, we&#39;d love to hear from you.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Présentation du poste :&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Au sein de l’équipe Data Analytics d&#39;Artefact, vous rejoignez un pôle clé couvrant le dashboarding, l&#39;analytics engineering, la mesure marketing et le low-code data science. Dans un environnement à forte croissance, vous intervenez auprès de grands comptes pour transformer leurs enjeux business grâce à une collecte, un traitement et une visualisation de données performants.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ce qu’on attend de vous :&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;En tant que profil Senior, vous garantissez l&#39;excellence technique et la qualité de la valeur livrée sur vos projets analytiques. Vous jouez un rôle de conseiller de confiance auprès des clients, tout en mentorant des profils plus juniors et en intégrant les derniers usages d&#39;IA Générative appliqués à l&#39;analytics.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Vos missions :&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Piloter la livraison de projets Analytics de bout en bout : du cadrage des cas d&#39;usage avec les équipes métier jusqu&#39;au déploiement de dashboards, pipelines et produits data décisionnels.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Concevoir et implémenter des architectures analytiques scalables en appliquant les pratiques modernes d&#39;Analytics Engineering (modélisation de données, tests, qualité de code).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exploiter les développements récents en GenAI pour maximiser la valeur délivrée à nos clients.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extraire des insights stratégiques et les restituer de manière claire et actionnable pour accompagner la prise de décision des parties prenantes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Agir en expert référent auprès des clients : construire une relation de confiance et apporter des recommandations sur les meilleures pratiques d&#39;analyse de données.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mentorer les Data Analysts juniors, partager les meilleures pratiques (ateliers, documentation) et participer à la création d&#39;accélérateurs internes et à la veille technologique.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Profil recherché :&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Expérience &amp;amp; Mindset :&lt;/strong&gt; 3 ans ou plus d&#39;expérience concrète dans un environnement data-driven, avec autonomie, rigueur et curiosité intellectuelle.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Domaines d&#39;expertise (au moins 1) :&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Dashboarding &amp;amp; Dataviz (Power BI, Looker, Tableau, Superset)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analytics Engineering (dbt sur BigQuery, Snowflake, Databricks)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Marketing Analytics &amp;amp; Mesure (CDP, MMM, attribution, Clean Rooms)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Low-Code / No-Code Data Science (Dataiku, Copilot Studio)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Socle Technique :&lt;/strong&gt; Solide maîtrise de SQL et Python, bases en Git et principes d&#39;ingénierie logicielle (versioning, tests), ainsi qu&#39;une expérience sur les environnements Cloud (GCP, Azure, AWS).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Posture &amp;amp; Communication :&lt;/strong&gt; Capacité avérée à faire le pont entre équipes techniques et métier, accompagnement des profils juniors et communication claire.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Process de recrutement :&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;HR Call :&lt;/strong&gt; Échange initial sur votre parcours, vos motivations et l&#39;adéquation culturelle.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical Interview :&lt;/strong&gt; Évaluation approfondie de votre socle technique (SQL, Python, Cloud) et de vos expertises Analytics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Business Interview :&lt;/strong&gt; Mise en situation sur la résolution de cas d&#39;usage business et la restitution analytique.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Fit Interview :&lt;/strong&gt; Échange final de projection opérationnelle et de fit culturel.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Rémunération :&lt;/strong&gt; Package : 53 000 € à 63 000 € brut annuel (fixe) + 5 000 € de variable, selon expérience et séniorité.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Présentation entreprise&lt;/strong&gt; Artefact est un cabinet de conseil spécialisé en data et en intelligence artificielle, qui accompagne les entreprises pour transformer ces technologies en impact business concret et mesurable. A la croisée du conseil, de la data et de la technologie, nos 2 500 collaborateurs dans 27 pays mettent leurs expertises en commun pour concevoir, développer et déployer des solutions qui répondent aux enjeux de transformation de nos clients. Envie d&#39;en savoir plus? Découvrez Artefact, nos expertises et notre culture : &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.artefact.com/?utm_source=gemini&quot;&gt;https://www.artefact.com&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Chez Artefact, nous sommes convaincus que la diversité des parcours, des expériences et des perspectives fait la richesse de nos équipes. Nous nous engageons à offrir un environnement inclusif et des opportunités équitables, où chacune et chacun peut évoluer et exprimer pleinement son potentiel. Nos recrutements reposent sur les compétences, le potentiel et l&#39;adéquation avec le rôle.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

