&lt;p&gt;- &amp;nbsp;You have demonstrated success in your first 2-3+ years of career at a tier 1 consulting firm and have 2+ years of experience managing projects and/or clients;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;- &amp;nbsp;Experience in data related topics, including but not limited to data transformation program, cloud infrastructure, AI &amp;amp; machine learning;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;- &amp;nbsp;Chines (Mandarin) native speaker, and fluent in English;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;- &amp;nbsp;Strong interest and appetite in Data, Marketing &amp;amp; Technology;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;- &amp;nbsp;Highly adaptable, able to cope with different topics and situations.&lt;/p&gt;
