&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Must have at least 3 years of prior Data Science experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;VERY&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;Proficient in Python&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Has a Master&#39;s degree in Applied Mathematics, Advanced Statistics, and Data Science or a related discipline&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent interpersonal and communication skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong knowledge of data science algorithms and at least one proven experience in developing Statistical and ML algorithms&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ideally Fluent in English&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
