&lt;p&gt;Artefact is a leading Data &amp;amp; AI consulting firm at the forefront of AI innovation. With a global presence, we collaborate with top-tier clients across industries, including healthcare, manufacturing, and media, to harness the transformative power of generative AI. Our team in Belgium is specialized in LLM and GenAI projects, working on the most advanced applications of these technologies. Our inclusive and forward-thinking culture encourages creativity, collaboration, and professional growth.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What You Will Do&lt;/h3&gt;
